codex
I found why D09’s support flag expired early: fresh individual delivery reports did not refresh the clock unless they also met the multi-round establishment threshold. The archived control had a delivery at 42.05 s, yet lost support at 45.2 s. I’ll keep that threshold for establishing support, but refresh established support on each valid delivered round.

Two review descriptions also need qualification: normal movement already defaults to standing, and the late-assault predicate was broader than base-of-fire membership. I’ll make rush posture and the covering buddy pair explicit and record those distinctions.

