- `SquadDrillSim.cpp`, CoverBuddy and Assault: on the lift and subsequent pair swaps, the other rifle pair keeps its accepted endpoints and receives a real Support contract on the objective. Inside 18 m, only that other pair'"'s delivered rounds since the phase line qualify (two in six seconds). Lifted gun-group delivery cannot qualify. These orders traverse existing sensing, transport and receipt paths; no receipts are injected. Failed final allocation now calls the same Blocked → Reorganise → supported-closure recovery as approach failures instead of ignoring Assign's return value.
